{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28077","headline":"甲子岁书事 · 杨乘","name":"甲子岁书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竖子未鼎烹，大君尚旰食。\n风雷随出师，云霞有战色。\n犒功椎万牛，募勇悬千帛。\n武士日曳柴，飞将竞执馘。\n喜气迎捷书，懽声送羽檄。\n天兵日雄强，桀犬稍离析。\n贼臂既已断，贼喉既已搤。\n乐祸但鲸鲵，同恶爲肘腋。\n小大势难侔，逆顺初不敌。\n违命固天亡，恃险乖长策。\n虿毒久萌牙，狼顾非日夕。\n礼貌忽骄狂，疏奏遂指斥。\n动衆岂佳兵，含忍恐无益。\n鸿恩既已孤，小效不足惜。\n腐儒一铅刀，投笔时感激。\n帝阍不敢干，恓恓坐长画。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨乘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28077.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28077","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}